# promise: #601
# Settings ▸ Tabs "Reopen tabs from this Space only" (#601, not in Arc). The issue's steps: Tab 1
# closed in Home, Tab 2 closed in Work, back to Home, ⇧⌘T. Arc switches to Work for Tab 2 (and so
# does Cra with the switch off, ReopenClosedTabTests); with it on, Tab 1 comes back in Home and the
# window stays there. ⇧⌘T again finds nothing closed in Home and stays put. The decision is
# ReopenClosedTab (CraCore); the store's half is StoreTests.reopenClosedTabInThisSpaceOnly.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false, "reopenClosedTabCurrentSpaceOnly": true}
